  "details": "1. Block, mute, or unmute a user\n\n2. Other user deletes their account fully\n\n3. VRChat moderation lists still retain deleted the user IDs, resulting in errors in the VRChat application log, and currently a 504 Gateway Timeout error for those moderation entries on PC.\n\nIt's a little difficult to test on my end to see if it's still happening, but it's currently impossible to correct this from the website or application at the moment, requiring a manual web API call to remove these deleted users from moderation action lists.\n\nIf user IDs can never come back after being deleted fully, and can't be reused, I'd assume deleted IDs should be automatically removed from moderation lists when they are deleted (if this hasn't already been fixed on the database side).",
